      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To write a structured JSON log event to a managed logging service, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I'll use AWS CloudWatch Logs as the managed logging service. To make the provider identifiable in the code, I'll import the AWS SDK (Boto3) and use the CloudWatch Logs client to send the log event. </thinking>\n",
